 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html\n  SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\" dir=\"ltr\"><head><title>Working with Purchase Orders</title><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"You can view a PO to find the status of the ordered item or service, make changes to the PO, or cancel the PO if needed.\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"You can view a PO to find the status of the ordered item or service, make changes to the PO, or cancel the PO if needed.\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen,projection\" href=\"/resource/css/style-v2.css\"><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"js/sap-strings.js\"></script></head><body class=\"en-us sap-light centered navigation-default enumeration-disabled collapsify-enabled\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-container\" class=\"container_12\" role=\"application\"><div id=\"d4h5-section-container\" class=\"grid_12\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-content\" class=\"grid_8 alpha omega\"><section><div class=\"page concept  - topic-topic concept-concept \" id=\"loiod03fc6c6faa94a6398d87d54c0fca5f7\"><h1 class=\"title topictitle1\">Working with Purchase Orders</h1><p class=\"shortdesc\">You can view a PO to find the status of the ordered item or service, make changes to\nthe PO, or cancel the PO if needed.</p><div class=\"related-links\"> <br><ul class=\"ullinks\"><div><strong><a class=\"link\" href=\"71470a525cca492396a0b829511470c8.html\" title=\"Find your purchase orders (POs) to display the status of ordered items or services.\">Finding POs</a></strong><br></div><div><strong><a class=\"link\" href=\"2a2d923936614836ad85239723be5300.html\" title=\"If you need to change a request or PO, you can do it after the PO reaches Ordered status. After your change has been approved, guided buying automatically sends the supplier a PO containing details of the change.\">Changing Requests or POs</a></strong><br></div><div><strong><a class=\"link\" href=\"4656e7c61da143dba3496ed62947bb90.html\" title=\"If you need to cancel a 